      "snippet": "WikiTraffic-TSFM A trained rank-8 TimesFM 2.5 200M adapter for 28-day daily Wikipedia pageview forecasts. It uses 352 days of log-transformed counts and was fine-tuned on English/Portuguese science articles. Actual adapter weights, dated forecasts, training code and independent audit results are included. It beats seasonal baselines on this cohort."
